&lt;li&gt;Run rapid, iterative experiments to test hypotheses and surface insights that drive model improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with researchers and engineers to translate cutting-edge academic advances into practical, production-ready systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain robust ML pipelines for data ingestion, feature engineering, model training, and evaluation&lt;/li&gt;
